  aciklama:
  - "Telvelerinde pencere pervaz\u0131na ince bir cambazl\u0131kla dikilmi\u015F,
    camdan d\u0131\u015Far\u0131y\u0131 izleyen bir kedi g\xF6r\xFCyorum. D\u0131\u015Far\u0131da
    ise \xF6zg\xFCrce u\xE7an kargalar var. Adeta \xF6zeniyor gibi, b\xFCy\xFCk bir
    dikkatle bak\u0131yor onlara. Bu kedi, e\u011Fitim hayat\u0131nda \xE7ok y\xFCksek
    hedeflerin olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret ediyor. Kendini yeterince
    tan\u0131mad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131, kendine tam manas\u0131yla inanmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    ve y\xFCksek ba\u015Far\u0131lar\u0131n hayalini kurmaktan \u015Fimdiden ka\xE7\u0131nd\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Fincan\u0131n, bu anlamda hayat\u0131n seni \xE7ok yan\u0131ltaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    s\xF6yl\xFCyor {{isim}}. E\u011Fer elinden geleni son raddesine kadar yaparsan,
    kalan a\xE7\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"\u015Fans\" sayabilece\u011Fin bir fakt\xF6rle
    evrenin tamamlayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilmeni isterim. "
